-- parity_exempt --
reason: structured-metadata-unobservable
detail: `rate({service_name="api"}[5m]) / ignoring(level) rate({service_name="api", level="info"}[5m])` answers with cerberus's synthesised `detected_level` label, which upstream produces at ingestion and the in-process querier therefore never carries
